          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Choice of Shipping Carrier",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Orders may be shipped with either the US Postal Service, UPS, or FedEx. If a specific courier service is desired please let us know.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "text_FFC9KF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Warranty Shipping",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>If you need to redeem a product warranty both the repair and return postage will be paid for by us. To ship the product to our workshop, however, the customer will need to purchase their own postage.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
